{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769910/extras/bioexplore.png?t=1748389299\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the world of Razgovor Online, Even with its Limitations!<br>Providing a Limited version of the Open world map allowing you to go between locations and visit places like &quot;The Vault Underground&quot;.<br><br>The Demo provides you a taste of the world by letting you visit:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bonsila Town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bonsilashire Park</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minstfield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Vault Underground</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Create your own experiance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769910/extras/biocybergen.png?t=1748389299\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own experiance, customise your own look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit the Clothing Shops and Hair Shops to customise your look and style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can buy your clothes and Hair Style from places such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cyber-Genesis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">UNLOCKED</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunters R U</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raz Hair</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Find Your Community</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769910/extras/biocybercommunity.png?t=1748389299\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even though this is just a Demo, It doesnt mean you can't find your community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join on your friends or meet new people along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Socialize with your friends or others either in Desktop or VR! The choice is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Laser-Tag Mini-Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769910/extras/biominigames.png?t=1748389299\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete against your friends or other players in Laser-Tag.<br><br>With only 2 Maps to select form, you can show off you skills in each areana.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3769910?t=1748389299","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3769910?t=1748389299","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769910/111032552a79a3dba481525913502be3ccc4797b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748389299","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769910/111032552a79a3dba481525913502be3ccc4797b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748389299","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769910/extras/bioexplore.png?t=1748389299\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the world of Razgovor Online, Even with its Limitations!<br>Providing a Limited version of the Open world map allowing you to go between locations and visit places like &quot;The Vault Underground&quot;.<br><br>The Demo provides you a taste of the world by letting you visit:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bonsila Town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bonsilashire Park</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minstfield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Vault Underground</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Create your own experiance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769910/extras/biocybergen.png?t=1748389299\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own experiance, customise your own look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit the Clothing Shops and Hair Shops to customise your look and style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can buy your clothes and Hair Style from places such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cyber-Genesis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">UNLOCKED</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunters R U</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raz Hair</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Find Your Community</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769910/extras/biocybercommunity.png?t=1748389299\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even though this is just a Demo, It doesnt mean you can't find your community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join on your friends or meet new people along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Socialize with your friends or others either in Desktop or VR! The choice is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Laser-Tag Mini-Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769910/extras/biominigames.png?t=1748389299\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete against your friends or other players in Laser-Tag.<br><br>With only 2 Maps to select form, you can show off you skills in each areana.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Broken Light Games"],"fullgame":